msgid "Pre-Selecting Data"
msgstr "Välja data i förväg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:772
msgid "Using Worksheets"
msgstr "Arbeta med kalkylblad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Worksheet Overview"
msgstr "Översikt över kalkylblad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"Worksheets contain the elements, such as the cell grid area, which provide "
"the principal work entities for <application>Gnumeric</application> users. "
"The worksheet grid area allows users to enter data, develop analyses of "
"these data, and display both data and results. Worksheets also contain "
"graphical elements such as graphs and widgets. Worksheets are grouped into a"
" workbook which is stored in a <application>Gnumeric</application> file. The"
" manipulation of workbooks is explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"workbooks\"/> while the material below explains the manipulation of "
"worksheets."
msgstr ""
"Kalkylblad innehåller de delar som "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-användare främst arbetar med, till "
"exempel cellrutnätet. Där kan du mata in data, analysera dem och visa både "
"data och resultat. Kalkylblad innehåller även grafiska element som diagram "
"och widgetar. Flera kalkylblad samlas i en arbetsbok som sparas i en "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-fil. Mer information om hur du arbetar "
"med arbetsböcker finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-workbooks\"/>. Avsnitten nedan"
" beskriver hur du arbetar med kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:16
msgid ""
"Worksheets contain both working elements and metadata elements. The working "
"elements include the data contents of cells in the grid area, cell comments,"
" cell formatting, and sheet objects, such as graphical plots. The metadata "
"include the worksheet name and worksheet settings controlling the visual "
"appearance of the worksheet or the display of the worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Kalkylblad innehåller både arbetsdata och metadata. Arbetsdata omfattar "
"cellernas innehåll i rutnätet, cellkommentarer, cellformatering och "
"bladobjekt som diagram. Metadata omfattar kalkylbladets namn och "
"inställningar som styr kalkylbladets utseende eller visning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:25
msgid ""
"This section explains the main ways to manipulate "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> worksheets. <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"worksheets-navigation\"/> explains how to navigate the worksheet to change "
"the area which is displayed and change the currently selected area. <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-worksheets-display\"/> presents several alternative settings "
"which alter the display of cell contents, of the grid area, of the worksheet"
" as a whole or of <application>Gnumeric</application> itself. <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-worksheets-settings\"/> explains how to alter settings which "
"affect all the contents of the worksheet such as the status of the content "
"protection mechanism. <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-printSettings\"/> "
"gives a brief explanation of the print settings which apply specifically to "
"each worksheet; a more complete explanation of the print settings is given "
"in <xref linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/>. Finally, <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"worksheets-managing\"/> explains how the entire collection of worksheets can"
" be manipulated so as to add, duplicate, delete or re-order the worksheets "
"within a workbook."
msgstr ""
"Det här avsnittet beskriver de viktigaste sätten att arbeta med kalkylblad i"
" <application>Gnumeric</application>. I <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-"
"navigation\"/> förklaras hur du navigerar i kalkylbladet för att ändra den "
"visade delen och markera ett annat område. <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-"
"display\"/> beskriver inställningar för visning av cellinnehåll, "
"cellrutnätet, hela kalkylbladet eller själva "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. I <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-"
"settings\"/> förklaras inställningar som påverkar kalkylbladets innehåll, "
"till exempel innehållsskydd. <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-"
"printSettings\"/> ger en kort översikt över utskriftsinställningarna för "
"varje kalkylblad. En mer utförlig beskrivning finns i <xref "
"linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/>. Slutligen beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"worksheets-managing\"/> hur du hanterar kalkylblad i en arbetsbok genom att "
"lägga till, duplicera, ta bort eller ordna om dem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:61
msgid "Worksheet Navigation"
msgstr "Navigera i kalkylblad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:63
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> worksheets can be conceived of as a "
"single, continuous, two-dimensional grid of cells. However, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> cannot display the entire grid at once "
"but only shows a portion of the worksheet. Since only a portion of the "
"worksheet can be seen at any particular time, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> provides users with several ways to "
"change the portion of the worksheet that is displayed. <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"worksheets-navigation-selection\"/> explains the various ways that the "
"display window can be moved to a different section of the worksheet grid, "
"while <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-display\"/> , further below, explains "
"more powerful methods to re-organize the display of the cell grid area."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-kalkylblad kan ses som ett enda "
"sammanhängande 2D-rutnät av celler. Eftersom "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> bara visar en del av rutnätet åt gången "
"erbjuder <application>Gnumeric</application> flera sätt att ändra vilken del"
" som visas. I <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-navigation-selection\"/> "
"beskrivs hur du flyttar visningsfönstret till en annan del av cellrutnätet. "
"Längre fram i <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-display\"/> beskrivs fler sätt"
" att ordna om visningen av cellrutnätet."

