#: C/gnumeric.xml:84
msgid "Moving Around a Worksheet"
msgstr "Flytta runt i ett kalkylblad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:93
msgid "Moving the Selection"
msgstr "Flytta markeringen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:109
msgid "Worksheet Display"
msgstr "Visning av kalkylblad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:111
msgid ""
"The display of each worksheet can be controlled by several settings and "
"configurations. The worksheet, conceptually, consists of a single continuous"
" two dimensional grid of cells arranged in rows by columns, and "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>, by default, displays a small portion of"
" the worksheet area as a continuous region."
msgstr ""
"Visningen av varje kalkylblad kan styras med flera inställningar. "
"Kalkylbladet består i princip av ett enda sammanhängande tvådimensionellt "
"rutnät med rader och kolumner. Som standard visar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> en mindre sammanhängande del av "
"kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:118
msgid ""
"A worksheet is created with the number of rows and columns specified by the "
"preference setting that can be adjusted on the <guilabel>Windows </guilabel>"
" tab of the Preference Dialog (see <xref linkend=\"sect-configuration-"
"preferences-windows\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Kalkylblad skapas med det antal rader och kolumner som anges i inställningen"
" på fliken <guilabel>Fönster </guilabel> i dialogrutan Inställningar (se "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-configuration-preferences-windows\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:125
msgid ""
"The maximum number of rows in a sheet is 16,777,216 and the maximum number "
"of columns is 16384. The dimensions of a sheet can only be set to powers of "
"2."
msgstr ""
"Ett blad kan innehålla högst 16 777 216 rader och 16 384 kolumner. Bladets "
"mått kan endast ställas in till potenser av 2."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:131
msgid ""
"The size of an existing sheet can be increased through the <guilabel> Resize"
" Sheet</guilabel> dialog accessible through the sheet tab context menu (see "
"<xref linkend=\"menu-context-tabs\"/>) or the <guilabel>Sheet </guilabel> "
"submenu of the <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> menu (see <xref linkend=\"Edit-"
"Menu\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan utöka ett befintligt blad i dialogrutan <guilabel>Ändra storlek på "
"blad</guilabel>. Öppna dialogrutan via bladflikens snabbmeny (se <xref "
"linkend=\"menu-context-tabs\"/>) eller undermenyn <guilabel>Blad </guilabel>"
" i menyn <guilabel>Redigera</guilabel> (se <xref linkend=\"Edit-Menu\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:142
msgid "Worksheet Appearance"
msgstr "Kalkylbladets utseende"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:144
msgid ""
"A number of aspects of how a worksheet is displayed in the cell grid can be "
"modified. To adjust the display of formulas or results, A1 or R1C1 notation "
"for cell references, how cells with a value of zero are displayed, the "
"presence or absence of grid lines or row or column headers, or whether "
"columns are ordered left to right or right to left, see the description of "
"the <xref linkend=\"format-menu-sheet\"/> submenu."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra flera aspekter av hur kalkylbladet visas i cellrutnätet. Om du "
"vill justera visningen av formler eller resultat, A1- eller R1C1-notation "
"för cellreferenser, nollvärden, rutnät, rubriker för rader och kolumner "
"eller kolumnernas ordning från vänster till höger eller höger till vänster "
"kan du läsa beskrivningen av undermenyn <xref linkend=\"format-menu-"
"sheet\"/>."

